कुट्ट् कुट्ट्, cl. 10. P. कुट्टयति, अचुकुट्टत्,
यितुम्, to cut, divide; to grind or pound;
to multiply; to censure, abuse.

कुटीर, अस् or अम्, m. n. a small house, a hut, a
hovel; a kind of plant; (अम्), n. sexual intercourse;
exclusiveness.

कुटुम्बक, अस्, आ, अम्, being of one family;
(अम्), n. a household; the duties and cares of a house-
holder; a family, kindred.
